sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor R as Requester
    participant UI as Browser
    participant RT as Routes
    participant S as ChangeRequestService
    participant W as WorkflowService
    participant DB as Database

    R->>UI: Fill in title, description, type, priority, component
    UI->>RT: POST /change-requests
    RT->>RT: Check the user is signed in
    RT->>S: create(form data, user)
    S->>S: Validate required fields and allowed values
    alt Invalid input
        S-->>RT: Validation errors
        RT-->>UI: Show form again with error messages
    else Valid input
        S->>DB: Insert change request (next CR number, status Submitted, due date)
        S->>W: record initial status (Submitted)
        W->>DB: Insert status history row
        DB-->>S: Saved in one transaction
        S-->>RT: New change request
        RT-->>UI: Redirect to the change request page
    end
